WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.502 --> 00:00:14.084
- Hey copper jockey, how
much you made today, huh?

00:00:14.084 --> 00:00:16.500
30 cents?
- 45, actually.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.990
- Oh, 45 cents, huh?

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:21.715
Here's 50, keep the
change, you filthy animal.

00:00:21.715 --> 00:00:23.798
(laughs)

00:00:25.043 --> 00:00:28.626
Hey Penny Lane, I'm talking to you.

00:00:28.626 --> 00:00:30.509
You know what I can't figure out?

00:00:30.509 --> 00:00:32.507
Why we take our best president

00:00:32.507 --> 00:00:35.340
and put him on the most shit coin.

00:00:37.819 --> 00:00:38.902
- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:50.023 --> 00:00:52.631
(laughs)

00:00:52.631 --> 00:00:54.405
- [Quarters] So this girl comes
up to me, right, new girl.

00:00:54.405 --> 00:00:55.535
Apparently in charge of making the--

00:00:55.535 --> 00:00:58.256
- You guys mind if grab a
little lunch here with ya?

00:00:58.256 --> 00:01:00.839
- [Quarters] Yeah, have a seat.

00:01:01.906 --> 00:01:03.239
- You heard him.

00:01:04.451 --> 00:01:06.135
- So anyways, this girl
says she's in charge

00:01:06.135 --> 00:01:08.052
of the $2 bills, right.

00:01:11.648 --> 00:01:13.731
(laughs)

00:01:15.248 --> 00:01:16.528
- Satisfying.

00:01:16.528 --> 00:01:18.383
(clears throat)

00:01:18.383 --> 00:01:19.909
- Who the hell are you?

00:01:19.909 --> 00:01:22.576
(intense music)

00:01:33.863 --> 00:01:35.113
- Please don't.

00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:39.227
- That was really good.

00:01:43.234 --> 00:01:45.484
(groaning)

00:01:49.378 --> 00:01:52.711
- Not you, you get the fuck out of here.

00:02:12.488 --> 00:02:15.905
(high-pitched whistling)

00:02:23.844 --> 00:02:24.677
Hey man.

00:02:27.171 --> 00:02:30.018
- You ever keep up with Nickel
and Dimes, are those guys?

00:02:30.018 --> 00:02:30.897
- I haven't seen 'em for awhile,

00:02:30.897 --> 00:02:33.035
they stopped returning my calls.

00:02:33.035 --> 00:02:35.182
- You were kind of a jerk.

00:02:35.182 --> 00:02:37.790
- Yeah, I'm sorry about that,

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:39.976
I really kinda let the responsibility--

00:02:39.976 --> 00:02:42.059
- Water under the bridge.

00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:47.487
Oh don't worry about
it, I got it, I got it.

00:02:48.891 --> 00:02:50.100
Oh.

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:51.890
- We don't have any bitcoins.

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:56.057
- Yeah, we actually used to
work at the Mint together.

